## Share the output returned by the last node

Output of the "Code2" node (feeding into the "If1" check before "Create a lead"):

```json
[
  {
    "zoho_id": null
  }
]
```

Since `zoho_id` is `null`, the "If1" node routes to the "Create a lead" branch rather than "Update a lead" — even though a lead with the same email already exists in Zoho. The "Create a lead" node then fails with the generic "unknown issue" error instead of a clear duplicate-record message.

